.SH DEPENDENCIES
At bare minimum python3 and FFmpeg. SoX is required for any resampling,
and rubberband for any pitch shifting (-p, -S and pitch -D jobs).
A \fBqaac\fR binary is used for ALAC/AAC when
present, with automatic fallback to FFmpeg (AAC fallback warns: it sounds
worse). \fBlame\fR is the preferred MP3 encoder (libmp3lame fallback);
\fBopusenc\fR is the preferred Opus encoder (ffmpeg libopus fallback). The \fBmetaflac\fR tool
(from the flac package) forces Cover (front) picture types and
exact COMMENT/DESCRIPTION/ENCODER tags on FLAC outputs; a run needing
those fixes refuses to proceed without it (install flac).
Run \fBnightcore --check\fR to verify every tool, encoder and tag
reader at once (same report on Linux and the Windows builds).
